      "Flight #\n617/7\n615/5516\n739/5562\nSAN DIEGO TO LAKE TAHOE\nLeave\n7:00 A\n12:00 N\n3:40 P\nArrive\n11:20 A\n3:40 P\n6:30 P\n# Stops\nVia SNA\nVia OAK\nVia SJC\n$35.00\nFrequency\nSa\nMo thru Fr\nSu\n5516/630\n5552/642\n5552/762\n5562/754\n5560/664\n505/5515\n509/7\n425/5516\n723/5516\n515/5516\n539/5562\n5516/540\n5552/552\n5562/560\n5562/562\n5516/538\n5562/452\n5515\n615/5516\n339/5562\n243/5562\nLAKE TAHOE TO SAN DIEGO\n1:30 P\n4:55 P\nVia SJC\n4:25 P\n8:00 P\nVia OAK\n4:25 P\n9:10 P\nVia SNA\n4:25 P\n7:25 P\nVia SJC\n7:00 P\n9:35 P\nVia OAK\nONTARIO TO LAKE TAHOE\n8:45 A\n12:50 P\nVia OAK\n9:00 A\n11:20 A\nVia OAK\n12:00 N\n3:40 P\nVia OAK\n12:00 N\n3:40 P\nVia SJC\n12:00 N\n3:40 P\nVia OAK\n4:15 P\n6:30 P\nVia SJC\nLAKE TAHOE TO ONTARIO\n1:30 P\n4:20 P\nVia SJC\n4:25 P\n6:35 P\nVia OAK\n4:25 P\n7:50 P\nVia SJC\n4:25 P\n8:00 P\nVia OAK\n1:30 P\n3:45 P\nVia SJC\n4:25 P\n6:35 P\nVia OAK\nORANGE\nCOUNTY TO LAKE TAHOE\n8:45 A\n10:15 A\n12:35 P\n4:00 P\n3:30 P\n11:20 A\n2\n12:50 P\n2\n3:40 P\nVia OAK\n6:30 P\nVia SJC\n6:30 P\nVia SJC\n35.00\nMo thru Th\nMo thru Th\nSa\nSu\nSu\n32.00\nMo thru Fr\nSa\nFr\nSa\nSu\nSu\n32.00\nFr\nMo thru Th\nFr\nSa\nSu\nSu\n32.00\nSa\nSu thru Fr\nMo thru Fr\nFr\nSu\n5516/630\n5516/242\n5552\nLAKE TAHOE TO\n1:30 P\n4:20 P\n1:30 P\n3:30 P\n4:25 P\n7:00 P\n5562/250\n5562/254\n5560\n4:25 P\n4:25 P\n7:00 P\n7:30 P\n7:00 P\n9:35 P\nORANGE COUNTY\n32.00\nVia SJC\nMo thru Th\nVia SJC\nFr\n2\nMo thru Th\n\u0026 Sa\nVia OAK\nVia OAK\nFr\nSu\nFri \u0026 Su\nFlights 1-99: Lockheed L-188 Electrajets\nFlights 100-900: Boeing 737 Fanjets\nCall Easy Information first whenever you're travel-\ning in California. If our schedule doesn't quite match\nyours, we'll still help you find the easy way. And we\ncan arrange rental cars and hotels, too.\nNow, that's easy to take!\nColton\nDisneyland/ Orange County\nDowney\nEl Monte\nLaguna\nLake Tahoe\nLos Angeles\nOntario\nPalm Springs\nSan Diego\nSacramento\nSan Francisco\nSan Mateo\nSan Jose\nOakland\nW